title: Folk Song in Six
key: Em
tempo: 66
meter: 6/8
style: acoustic

// Two slow pulses to the bar, three eighths in each. The verse stays in the
// minor and turns home through the five, with two chords a pulse each in its
// seventh bar; the chorus opens on the relative major and walks down to the
// four through the five over its third.
[Verse]
| Em | C | G     | D  |
| Em | C | Am B7 | Em |

[Chorus]
| G | D | Em | C  |
| G | D/F# | C B7 | Em |
